poses —A rizona\nBY THE PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES \nOF AMERICA\nA PROCLAMATION\nWHEREAS it appears that certain  \nlands which are now a part of the Wu­\npatki National Monument in the State  \nof Arizona, established by Proclamation  \nof December 9, 1924, 43 Stat. 1977, and  \nenlarged by Proclamation of July 9 ,1937,1  \n50 Stat. 1841, are not necessary for the  \nproper care and management of the ob­\njects of historic and scientific interest  \nsituated on the lands within the said  \nmonument; and\nWHEREAS it appears that it would be  \nin the public ‘ interest to exclude such  \nlands from the Wupatki National Mon­\nument; and\nWHEREAS such lands are needed in  \nthe construction and operation of a di­\nversion dam in Little Colorado River to  \nfacilitate the irri","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_8645.txt","sha256":"fe55ef8609c24f0a0513b242620d9a44989100b5e648423e15d729c2ac072852","source":{"line":131,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"f173748c9332356216c11c3440e88cae9310fcfd4caec6377ff47ffbefde855b"}}]}
